{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deb, long time no talk. A lot's happened! On Friday I had a breakthrough with my engineering project. Finally found a solution to a prob that's been bugging me. Feels great to see my hard work paying off."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-5bcfaa02efe50619c35cf8dc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:53:48.561465+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5bcfaa02efe50619c35cf8dc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5bcfaa02efe50619c35cf8dc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You've really proven your skills. Feels great, right? Keep it up! And I bought new props for the yoga class! Here it is in action."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-46d07e997ac63928cc0e9cf1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:53:52.632905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46d07e997ac63928cc0e9cf1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46d07e997ac63928cc0e9cf1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Oh, I also have new details for this case! Rate it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-f06732f71142ad52122a8eb8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:53:56.720037+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f06732f71142ad52122a8eb8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f06732f71142ad52122a8eb8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That`s cool! I also bought this candle for the atmosphere and to improve my yoga practice. How about you? When you do it, what feelings do you get?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-77dff537307e9c416f4d57c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:00.820562+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "77dff537307e9c416f4d57c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "77dff537307e9c416f4d57c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I feel relaxed during this activity. I love creating a serene space with soothing scents like lavender and rosemary. Do you have any favorite scents or rituals for when you do it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-684e0be56335398cb226b6f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:04.910597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "684e0be56335398cb226b6f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "684e0be56335398cb226b6f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I'm also a big fan of scents like this! Candles and essential oils add warmth and calm to my yoga session. It's amazing how certain smells can transport you to a place of peace. Do you have any other ways to enhance your yoga practice?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-0721d35eb0df3ace51bd8886", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:08.995622+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0721d35eb0df3ace51bd8886", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0721d35eb0df3ace51bd8886", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I find music helps me. Any favorite tracks?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-654813171423a49afd45c0c5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:13.081382+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "654813171423a49afd45c0c5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "654813171423a49afd45c0c5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I find instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rhythms help create a peaceful vibe. One of my favorites is a track called \"Savana.\" What songs/artists do you like listening to during your practice?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-b23c349370761c91c2fcbd1d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:17.181407+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b23c349370761c91c2fcbd1d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b23c349370761c91c2fcbd1d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I love listening to Nils Frahm and Olafur Arnalds during my practice. Their music is so calming and puts me in a different headspace. Do you have any recommendations for other similar artists or tracks I should check out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-92da06d0d96846d1a0e99b69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:21.268533+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "92da06d0d96846d1a0e99b69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "92da06d0d96846d1a0e99b69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Also, I'm listening to an album called 'Sleep,' which is great for meditation and deep relaxation. Hope you find it as calming as I do!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-0d12c56f54f9ff6c648ef607", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:25.339334+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d12c56f54f9ff6c648ef607", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d12c56f54f9ff6c648ef607", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks for the tips, Deborah! I'm gonna check them out. It's always good to have some new tunes for yoga!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-ca0401b96a60e595e0cd3d59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:29.422758+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ca0401b96a60e595e0cd3d59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ca0401b96a60e595e0cd3d59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Let me know your thoughts on the albums!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-22cb76f50639ba82f61bcb5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:33.494882+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22cb76f50639ba82f61bcb5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22cb76f50639ba82f61bcb5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: See you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-b071eb8e83672501222ebf24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:37.589251+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b071eb8e83672501222ebf24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b071eb8e83672501222ebf24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Take care and keep up the good work!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-48/session_11-22a8f2e404128b8e6574b9d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:54:41.690000+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22a8f2e404128b8e6574b9d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22a8f2e404128b8e6574b9d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
